 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Katsute no Ansatsusha ha Raise de Chigau Ikikata wo"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "The Former Assassin Lives Differently in the Afterlife"
   },
   {
    "ja": "かつての暗殺者は来世で違う生き方をする"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I never wanted to be born an assassin...\"\nMira, who was hailed as the strongest assassin, regretfully loses her life at the hands of a rival female knight.\nHowever, she awakens to find herself reincarnated as the daughter of an aristocrat, in the same world with the same name one year later...!?\nMira lived a low-key life, trying not to be discovered as a former assassin, but eventually she became interested in a life of protecting people, the polar opposite of her previous life, and decided to aim to become a soldier.\n\nThe unconventional story of a young assassin who gets reincarnated and restarts her life!!",
   "ja": "「暗殺者になんて、生まれたくなかったなぁ……」 最強の暗殺者と謳われたミラは後悔を抱えたまま、ライバルの少女騎士の手で生涯を終えてしまう。 しかし気がつけば、1年後の世界で同じ名前の貴族の娘として転生しており……!? 元暗殺者だとバレないように目立たず過ごしていたミラは、やがて前世と正反対の人を守る生き方に興味を抱いて兵士を目指すことに。 常識破りな暗殺少女の人生やり直し転生譚!!"
  },
